<title>CHINA: Cathay Pacific interim net down 35 pct.</title>
<headline>Cathay Pacific interim net down 35 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   31.1 vs 56.2</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    11.5 vs 11.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil vs 541.0</p>
<p>    Net			    1,068.0 vs 1,647.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		     15,775.0 vs 15,163.0</p>
<p>    Company name		 Cathay Pacific Airways Ltd</p>
<p>    Book close		   September 15-19</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   September 30</p>
<p>NOTE - Airline Cathay Pacific is 43.97 pct owned by Swire Pacific Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
